					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200470305
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 200470305,
					"content": "都是很有价值的线索，辛苦你了，这些就给你做谢礼吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200470306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "杜兰"
				},
				{
					"id": 200470306,
					"content": "帕琪！冒险计划又可以更新了——",
